  "overview": "Daniel L. Smith Jr., Ph.D., is an Associate Professor in the Department of Nutrition Sciences at UAB. His research focuses on the interaction of nutrition and metabolism in relationship to aging and disease. Topics include: obesity, calorie restriction, calorie restriction mimetics, brown adipose tissue, carbohydrate metabolism, and systems biology of aging using budding yeast chronological lifespan.",
